  Mn 0.1883280800 0.6883280800 0.5000000000
  Mn1 0.8116719200 0.3116719200 0.5000000000
  O 0.0000000000 0.5000000000 0.5000000000
  O 0.7044207100 0.7044207100 0.0000000000
  O 0.2955792900 0.2955792900 0.0000000000
K_POINTS automatic
  7 8 9 0 0 0
HUBBARD ortho-atomic
